message: "If you use this software or its experimental design, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Temporal Network Persistence from Partial Observations"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Borchardt"
    given-names: "Albert"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Cohen2000/MasterThesis"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Research software for estimating full-network temporal persistence from
  partial and potentially biased network observations using analytical
  estimators, supervised baselines, and language models.
keywords:
  - temporal networks
  - graph sampling
  - random walks
  - persistence estimation
  - language models
